{"title":"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Use_an_example)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Use an example)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>LeRoy and Bernardo went on a week-long trip together and agreed to share the costs equally. Over the week, each of them paid for various joint expenses such as gasoline and car rental. At the end of the trip it turned out that LeRoy had paid <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> dollars and Bernardo had paid <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> dollars, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/a/4daec1b65b2c7204eba605d45b19b072005b0218.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A &lt; B$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" />. How many dollars must LeRoy give to Bernardo so that they share the costs equally?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/6/746c8af13f9cba4179a1b8d7e0c390dc2d099933.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{A + B}{2} \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\dfrac{A - B}{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\dfrac{B - A}{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ B - A \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ A + B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"568\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The difference in how much LeRoy and Bernardo paid is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/b/f1b733a187ce539dcda5cdc3d49df586c7373f22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B-A$\" width=\"50\" height=\"13\" />. To share the costs equally, LeRoy must give Bernardo half of the difference, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/3/be34c4d7094e0c944b2a42bcf518f7146472f54e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } \\;\\frac{B-A}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"108\" height=\"50\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Use_an_example.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Use_an_example)\">Solution 2 (Use an example)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Use an example)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since there are no restrictions on cost paid besides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/c/35c6befbae2835211a36a77a5e2708937cc6faac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A&lt;B$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" />, we can use an example where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/3/ad3d7569bc4c2f4bb0e4baf2d7d5bd53c93435f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/6/34667280213dc960e0d44b3af027150c30f7b389.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B = 50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"14\" />. Quickly, we realize the only way they could pay the same amount of money is if they both pay 45 dollars. This means LeRoy must give Bernardo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/6/a96eb698887e78e4fd9ec0cf70ca706067e33867.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50 - 45 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />. Looking at the answer choices we see only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/8/36804394d91f5e1123f000a037b0e99eaa165d8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{50-40}{2} = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"98\" height=\"38\" /> works. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/3/be34c4d7094e0c944b2a42bcf518f7146472f54e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } \\;\\frac{B-A}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"108\" height=\"50\" />\n</p><p>~vsinghminhas\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/v8a5x98Xy_s\">https://youtu.be/v8a5x98Xy_s</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B\">2011 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b